[More]
<p>~B~E~i      No, I really wasn't much for making good storyline with my maps.  This was the final map of mine and it starts you under attack, with regenerating ice towers as your only defense.  Of the five maps, the first one and this one are probably the most difficult.  Not much else to say really.
<br>                             --Mike Byrne aka Australian_Dingo

